---
system: sys-16-parent-mobile-application
flow_id: rewards-and-leaderboard-mobile
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/16-parent-mobile-application
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway]
apis:
  - GET /v1/mobile/rewards
  - GET /v1/mobile/rewards/inbox
  - POST /v1/mobile/rewards/{rewardId}/seen
  - GET /v1/mobile/leaderboard
  - PUT /v1/mobile/devices/{deviceId}/leaderboard-preference
  - PATCH /v1/mobile/children/{childId}
externals: []
queues: [reward-seen-local-queue]
failure_paths:
  - malformed_response_rejected
  - cross_household_forbidden
  - offline_seen_ack_queued
idempotency: reward seen acknowledgement uses a stable reward-derived request ID; preference and child-name mutations are never queued
retry: cached reads may refresh after reconnect; only reward seen acknowledgement replays from the account-and-household-partitioned local queue
timeout: authenticated HTTP client default 30 seconds
status: final
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway

    ParentApp->>Gateway: GET /v1/mobile/rewards?childId&deviceId + Bearer
    Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200 private totals and ledger history
    ParentApp->>ParentApp: validate exact envelope and nullable reason/policy/streak snapshots

    ParentApp->>Gateway: GET /v1/mobile/rewards/inbox + Bearer
    Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200 unseen persisted rewards
    alt online acknowledgement
        ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/mobile/rewards/{rewardId}/seen + stable request ID
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200 seen receipt
    else offline acknowledgement
        ParentApp->>ParentApp: queue reward ID once under authenticated account and household key
        Note over ParentApp: rename and leaderboard preference are never queued
    end

    ParentApp->>Gateway: GET /v1/mobile/leaderboard?period&page&pageSize + Bearer
    Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200 public rows, owned rows, pagination
    ParentApp->>ParentApp: reject unmasked email or unexpected public fields

    ParentApp->>Gateway: PUT /v1/mobile/devices/{deviceId}/leaderboard-preference {optedIn}
    Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200 persisted preference
    ParentApp->>Gateway: PATCH /v1/mobile/children/{childId} {displayName}
    Gateway-->>ParentApp: 200 owned child display name

    alt cross_household_forbidden
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 403 shared error envelope without existence leak
    else malformed_response_rejected
        ParentApp->>ParentApp: raise INVALID_API_RESPONSE and do not cache payload
    end
